# 0.6548). KMAR-50K is CC BY 4.0 -- the ONLY corpus merge on this machine that is shippable at all
# (Rijeka CC BY-NC-ND, MRNet's Stanford agreement bars an adaptation, fastMRI bars a derivative), which
# is why these two are the only corpus lever whose answer can be read on the board instead of only
# offline. `grep -c mergedk comp/board.jsonl` returns 0.
